<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>融资成本攀升，港元创六个月新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hong-kong-dollar-hits-six-month-high-as-funding-costs-climb</link><description>受本地借贷成本飙升以及中国股市上涨之际投资者抢购香港股票的需求推动，港元涨势延续至六个月高位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hong-kong-dollar-hits-six-month-high-as-funding-costs-climb'&gt;融资成本攀升，港元创六个月新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hong Kong Dollar Hits Six-Month High as Funding Costs Climb&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hong-kong-dollar-hits-six-month-high-as-funding-costs-climb</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:18:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国投资者将不得不追逐反弹：市场分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-investors-will-have-to-chase-rally-3-minutes-mliv-video</link><description>盖伊·约翰逊 (Guy Johnson)、汤姆·麦肯齐 (Tom Mackenzie) 和马克·库德莫尔 (Mark Cudmore) 在“彭博社：开盘交易”中为分析师和投资者分析了今天的关键主题。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-investors-will-have-to-chase-rally-3-minutes-mliv-video'&gt;美国投资者将不得不追逐反弹：市场分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Investors Will Have to Chase Rally: Market Analysis&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-investors-will-have-to-chase-rally-3-minutes-mliv-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:22:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</link><description>加纳提前三个月赎回了四年期国内债券，政府试图增强投资者对经济从债务重组中复苏的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence'&gt;加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ghana Buys Back $1.1 Billion Domestic Bonds to Boost Confidence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:31:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</link><description>欧元兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大年度跌幅，欧洲官员呼吁中国让人民币进一步升值，以抑制进口激增。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year'&gt;欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Euro Set for Biggest Annual Drop Against Yuan in Two Decades&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>